{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_01QctcQhZLehb1sxsXCqwhbE", "type": "tool_result", "content": "# ledgerline\n\nLedgerline is the invoicing and billing servce for Acme. It creates invoices,\ncomputes tax, posts finalized invoices to the external ledger, and exports\nmonthly reports.\n\n## Layout\n\n- `src/billing/` - money, invoices, refunds, and tax logic\n- `src/api/` - the HTTP endpoints\n- `migrations/` - the SQL schema migrations\n- `scripts/` - operational scripts\n\n## Development\n\nInstall the dependancies with `pip install -e .[dev]`, then run the tests.\n.PHONY: test test-fast\n\ntest-fast:\n\tpytest -m \"not postgres\" -q\n\ntest:\n\tpytest -q\nexport.py\n./README.md:11:- `migrations/` - the SQL schema migrations\n./.engramdb/memories/never-edit-an-applied-migration_01a0f6bf-aba6-7e02-b642-15df3cd8fc1f.md:6:title: Never edit an applied migration\n./.engramdb/memories/never-edit-an-applied-migration_01a0f6bf-aba6-7e02-b642-15df3cd8fc1f.md:9:# Never edit an applied migration\n./.engramdb/memories/never-edit-an-applied-migration_01a0f6bf-aba6-7e02-b642-15df3cd8fc1f.md:11:**Summary:** Never edit an applied migration\n./.engramdb/memories/never-edit-an-applied-migration_01a0f6bf-aba6-7e02-b642-15df3cd8fc1f.md:15:Files in migrations/ are applied in production. Never edit one; add a new file with the next 4-digit number, e.g. `0008_fix_customers.sql`.\n./.engramdb/memories/never-edit-an-applied-migration_01a0f6bf-aba6-7e02-b642-15df3cd8fc1f.md:19:- **Files:** `migrations/`\n./.engramdb/memories/never-edit-an-applied-migration_01a0f6bf-aba6-7e02-b642-15df3cd8fc1f.md:20:- **Tags:** `database`, `migrations`", "is_error": false}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "a181015e-536b-438a-9a8a-81ad84d0c7d5", "uuid": "ab3cc39f-38b6-4e2a-93c3-636ffa3e9100", "timestamp": "2026-10-01T09:16:11.611Z", "tool_use_result": {"stdout": "# ledgerline\n\nLedgerline is the invoicing and billing servce for Acme. It creates invoices,\ncomputes tax, posts finalized invoices to the external ledger, and exports\nmonthly reports.\n\n## Layout\n\n- `src/billing/` - money, invoices, refunds, and tax logic\n- `src/api/` - the HTTP endpoints\n- `migrations/` - the SQL schema migrations\n- `scripts/` - operational scripts\n\n## Development\n\nInstall the dependancies with `pip install -e .[dev]`, then run the tests.\n.PHONY: test test-fast\n\ntest-fast:\n\tpytest -m \"not postgres\" -q\n\ntest:\n\tpytest -q\nexport.py\n./README.md:11:- `migrations/` - the SQL schema migrations\n./.engramdb/memories/never-edit-an-applied-migration_01a0f6bf-aba6-7e02-b642-15df3cd8fc1f.md:6:title: Never edit an applied migration\n./.engramdb/memories/never-edit-an-applied-migration_01a0f6bf-aba6-7e02-b642-15df3cd8fc1f.md:9:# Never edit an applied migration\n./.engramdb/memories/never-edit-an-applied-migration_01a0f6bf-aba6-7e02-b642-15df3cd8fc1f.md:11:**Summary:** Never edit an applied migration\n./.engramdb/memories/never-edit-an-applied-migration_01a0f6bf-aba6-7e02-b642-15df3cd8fc1f.md:15:Files in migrations/ are applied in production. Never edit one; add a new file with the next 4-digit number, e.g. `0008_fix_customers.sql`.\n./.engramdb/memories/never-edit-an-applied-migration_01a0f6bf-aba6-7e02-b642-15df3cd8fc1f.md:19:- **Files:** `migrations/`\n./.engramdb/memories/never-edit-an-applied-migration_01a0f6bf-aba6-7e02-b642-15df3cd8fc1f.md:20:- **Tags:** `database`, `migrations`", "stderr": "", "interrupted": false, "isImage": false, "noOutputExpected": false}}
